{
  "name": "dsh-hotkeys",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "DSH Custom Actions — bind DSH actions to 1-3 key chords (single or double tap), with the finish reminder's sound and raise switches on the same page. / 自定义操作：把 DSH 的操作绑成 1～3 个键的组合，单键可设单击或双击，并带完成提醒的声音与置顶开关。",
  "main": "./index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./raise-window.ps1": "./raise-window.ps1",
    "./toast-window.ps1": "./toast-window.ps1"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "raise-window.ps1",
    "toast-window.ps1",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": []
    }
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "hotkeys",
    "custom-actions",
    "自定义操作"
  ]
}
